<title>USA: Celestial 5.4 pct stake taken by investor.</title>
<headline>Celestial 5.4 pct stake taken by investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jacksonville, Fla. investor Gilchrist Berg said Friday he holds a 5.4 percent stake or 219,000 shares in Celestial Seasonings Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Berg said he bought 78,700 shares between Feb. 10 and April 10 at $21 to $22.41 a share.</p>
<p>Celestial Seasonings, based in Boulder, Colo., makes herbal and specialty black teas.</p>
